1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,980
Eh, korang!

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,800
Kenapa langit warna biru?

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,300
Kenapa bukan hijau?

4
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:05,380
Jom ikut Affan

5
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,620
terbang ke langit!

6
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,850
Waaaah!

7
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,420
Cahaya matahari sebenarnya

8
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,980
ada banyak warna!

9
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,200
Bila cahaya masuk ke udara,

10
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,380
ia bertemu molekul

11
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,850
yang sangat kecil.

12
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,460
Cahaya biru lebih banyak

13
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,160
tersebar ke semua arah

14
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,460
berbanding cahaya merah.

15
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,100
Sebab itulah kita nampak

16
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,450
langit berwarna biru!

17
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,180
Tapi... kenapa

18
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,900
waktu senja jadi oren?

19
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,600
Bila matahari rendah,

20
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:29,660
cahaya melalui

21
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,050
lebih banyak udara.

22
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,980
Banyak cahaya biru terserak,

23
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,560
jadi oren dan merah

24
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,720
lebih menonjol!

25
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:37,000
Ooooh!

26
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,780
Rupanya udara yang buat

27
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:40,400
langit nampak berwarna!

28
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,050
Haa,

29
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,420
sekarang korang dah tahu!

30
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,540
Misteri apa pula

31
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:44,750
Affan nak siasat?
